      "item_body": "<p>The electrical power p(t), in kilowatts, being used by a household as a function of time t, in hours, is modelled by a graph where t = 0 corresponds to 06:00. The graph indicates peak use at 08:00 and a power failure between 09:00 and 10:00. a. Determine lim(t\u21922) p(t). <span id=\"blank_30488fc1-ecce-4d7c-9caf-e4720bfc6705\"></span> b. Determine lim(t\u21924+) p(t) <span id=\"blank_276f3452-6c33-400b-a059-f40e81be59cb\"></span> and lim(t\u21924-) p(t) <span id=\"blank_15ad87a0-db3d-43e0-8984-e09125bece9e\"></span>. c. For what values of t is p(t) discontinuous? <span id=\"blank_fa89f88c-f3d0-4782-b3f7-91275fc5f16f\"></span> <span id=\"blank_612e32d2-b5ed-45fd-987b-fa34b5d0b329\"></span></p>",
